@@ -16,7 +16,12 @@ A tiny, dependency-free shipping quote service.
 
 ## Money
 
-Amounts are dollars, rounded to the cent with `roundDollars`.
+Amounts are integer cents everywhere inside the service — `baseRateFor`,
+`discountCents` and every `QuoteLine` are cents — and are converted to dollars
+with `centsToDollars` only at the edge, when a handler builds its reply.
+
+Sub-cent remainders go to the customer: surcharges round down, percentage
+discounts round up.
 
